        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3333' id='32' type-v2='text' w='26133' x='33733' y='72556'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#153250' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='12'>Projected Demand for AI-Related Skills (2019–2027)</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='18111' id='33' name='Skill Growth Demand' show-title='false' w='27600' x='33200' y='76333' />
        <zone h='5000' id='51' type-v2='text' w='13600' x='3133' y='16222'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Nearly half of the job taks have automation potential.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='4667' id='52' type-v2='text' w='13333' x='18067' y='16111'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Almost 1/3rd of roles are highly vulnerable to automation and may require reskilling.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='7000' id='53' type-v2='text' w='13533' x='33267' y='15778'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='8' italic='true'>Moderate reskilling urgency suggests workforce reskilling is needed in coming few years</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7333' id='54' type-v2='text' w='27600' x='3200' y='61556'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Finance</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'> and </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'>Energy</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true' lmargin='600' rmargin='600'> industries have the highest average automation risk, indicating greater exposure to AI-driven task automation.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='10556' id='55' type-v2='text' w='18400' x='43067' y='27444'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true'>AI automation is expected to increase salaries in analytical roles while reducing wages in routine and manual jobs.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone h='4333' id='56' type-v2='text' w='27600' x='33733' y='75444'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' italic='true'>Demand for AI-related skills in the job market is expected to steadily increase from 2020 to 2026.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='47000' id='57' type-v2='text' w='17200' x='62333' y='8667'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='14'>Key Insights</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>1. With an average automation risk of </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>46%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>, AI is expected to significantly transform many job roles.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>2. Amost </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>one-third of roles are highly vulnerable</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>, indicating the need for workforce reskilling.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>3.  These sectors have the </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>highest average automation exposure</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> due to data-driven and process-heavy tasks.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>4. Jobs like </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>Financial Analyst and Data Analyst</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'> may benefit, while routine roles may face wage decline.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>5. The job market shows </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>rising demand for AI skills</run>
            <run fontcolor='#0e5a8e' fontname='Times New Roman' fontsize='10'>, highlighting the importance of continuous upskilling.</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
